 was  freaking out the young kids you feel so  in the moment which is you know such a i  feel like that was such a luxury millie  bobby brown had no idea that vecna was  practical this season and it made her  cry blessed she burst into tears but it  kept her on her toes the fear was  genuine definitely very real i didn't  have to act  six plus hours in the makeup chair is  enough to drive anyone mad do you think  the design they landed on was the best  or would you have liked to see some more  of the concept art at play let us know  in the comments and thanks for hanging  out with us here at the things

